{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/hatenetis.png?t=1746557403\" />\u00a0a minimalistic\u00a0<strong>FPS movement\u00a0shooter.\u00a0</strong>An energy drink-sized time capsule of endless fighting. A micro-world of bots in a perpetual state of meaningless conversation with each other. Stay as long as you like - they've fought long before you, and they'll fight long after you're gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/gameplay.png?t=1746557403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/gameplay1.gif?t=1746557403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a simple and responsive player moveset, featuring sliding, jumping, and a double-jump that allows you to redirect your velocity. Kill enemies with your sword and gun and find unique interactions hidden in these mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/fightorobserve.png?t=1746557403\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/enemies1.gif?t=1746557403\" /> You are a rare visitor in this world. Go deep into chasing high-scores and watch as enemies begin to target you, escalating the gameplay into chaos. Alternatively, sit back and observe the bots stuck in the endless cycle of violence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/apasserby.png?t=1746557403\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/lobby1.gif?t=1746557403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Walk around the lobby and explore the world that houses none. Take it all in as the world hangs in a standstill, near entropy but never quite there... </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3659990?t=1746557403","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/58fcfd3b4c69e86f92d5b2eb431d42b799411530/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746557403","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/70754d7ed2c719e35a41b5e3f3966b4c77b55813/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746557403","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/70754d7ed2c719e35a41b5e3f3966b4c77b55813/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746557403","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/hatenetis.png?t=1746557403\" />\u00a0a minimalistic\u00a0<strong>FPS movement\u00a0shooter.\u00a0</strong>An energy drink-sized time capsule of endless fighting. A micro-world of bots in a perpetual state of meaningless conversation with each other. Stay as long as you like - they've fought long before you, and they'll fight long after you're gone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/gameplay.png?t=1746557403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3659990/extras/gameplay1.gif?t=1746557403\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master a simple and responsive player moveset, featuri